WEBVTT

00:00:00.369 --> 00:00:08.412
Dashboards put the numbers you care about on one screen. In this video, you’ll read a dashboard, build one with AI, and ask what it says.

00:00:09.436 --> 00:00:19.697
Open Dashboards. A dashboard is built from widgets: counts, tickets by any field, overdue work, trends, and data from your connected tools, like Square sales.

00:00:20.721 --> 00:00:24.689
Click Explain, and AI tells you what the numbers say, in a few points.

00:00:25.711 --> 00:00:31.236
Add widget lets you pick one and set it up, with a live preview. Each widget keeps its own color.

00:00:32.466 --> 00:00:41.383
Or describe the dashboard you want, and AI builds it, with a preview before anything is saved. Keep it private, share it with a team, or with everyone.
